// Rust: crates/jet-pkg-model/src/Bundler.rs:566
// BundlePlan -> BundlePlan182; all16 fields and complete deterministic layout.
// Rust: crates/jet-pkg-model/src/Bundler.rs:585
// impl BundlePlan: new586 and from_spec590 -> sole BundlePlan.from_spec202.
// It normalizes MSIX version, validates the complete spec, orders icons/hooks/
// categories/game assets and input facts, creates Linux AppRun/desktop/icon/
// updater layout, macOS executable/plist/resources layout and Windows manifest/
// logo/content-type/updater layout. Then it adds game files, refreshes Windows
// content types, emits the block map, rejects duplicate paths, sorts files and
// computes the canonical plan identity. No host platform dispatch is used.
